            "review_title": "Review at Rue Des Chats Salon De The",
            "review_text": "MichRennes\nRennes50 contributions\n0\nSorry\nAug 2015\nThis coffee shop doesn't exist anymore. We were so disappointed after walking quite a long distance under the rain... \nBut I you want to buy women's clothes you may find what you want. As this shop si still there.\nFor a five o'clock you might try the cafe de Paris or the sky bar at the Tirant Hotel (good chocolate cake).\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 4, 2015",
