            "review_title": "Review at Rue Des Chats Salon De The",
            "review_text": "Trung_Dang\nHanoi, Vietnam19 contributions\n0\nGreat Atmosphere\nJan 2014 • Friends\nA small, quiet and cozy little Parisian tea place in the centre of Hanoi. Very friendly staff, they also have some books for you to read while being there. If you want to get lost from the hustle Hanoi, or take your girlfriends for a lovely time, then this is the place to come. Wide ranges of tea to choose.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 24, 2014",
